---
title: "One command for one step of a run"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Breaks NeverBlindRepeat or UncertainStaysBlocked
    lg1: Path to the NeverBlindRepeat or UncertainStaysBlocked bug
  }
  class lg0 breaks
  class lg1 bugPath
  s0: first: Not sent / second: Not sent / step not started
  s1: first: Admitted: intent saved, handler not called / second: Not sent / step not started
  s2: first: Result in hand, not recorded, handler was called / second: Not sent / step not started
  s3: first: Recorded uncertain by its worker / second: Not sent / step uncertain
  s4: first: Uncertain, but the step is open again / second: Not sent / step failed, open to a new command
  s5: first: Uncertain, but the step is open again / second: Admitted: intent saved, handler not called / step failed, open to a new command
  s6: first: Uncertain, but the step is open again / second: Result in hand, not recorded, handler was called / step failed, open to a new command
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a caller sends the command (first)
  s1 --> s2: the handler is called and returns (first)
  s2 --> s3: the result is recorded as uncertain (first)
  s3 --> s3: revalidation takes the lease
  s3 --> s4: revalidation rejects an earlier step
  s4 --> s5: a caller sends the command (second)
  s5 --> s6: the handler is called and returns (second)
  classDef breaks fill:#ffecee,stroke:#e72e3b,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#cd2834
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 breaks
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 breaks
  class s6 bugPath
